<title>NORWAY: Norway GDP up 0.3 pct in Q2 - Statistics office.</title>
<headline>Norway GDP up 0.3 pct in Q2 - Statistics office.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's overall gross domestic product (GDP) grew 0.3 percent in the second quarter of 1996 after rising 1.6 percent in the first quarter, Statistics Norway said in a report on Thursday.</p>
<p>		     Key indicators qtr/qtr change (pct)</p>
<p>				   Q2 1996	 Q1 1996</p>
<p> Overall GDP			0.3	    1.6</p>
<p> Mainland GDP		     0.1	    1.0</p>
<p> Private consumption	    0.0	    2.2</p>
<p> Public consumption	     0.6	    1.0</p>
<p> Total gross investment	 3.3    minus 7.8</p>
<p> Exports		    minus 0.6	    4.0</p>
<p> Imports			    0.8    minus 1.9</p>
<p>--Rolf Soderlind, Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
